----

= Trust Recommendations =

You self-sustaining DPS — Waltzes / Steps / Samba. You need: tank (no enmity tools), healer (frees TP for WS), Haste, DPS fill. //Avoid other DNC trusts — steps/sambas/waltzes overlap and don't stack.//

{{html clean="false"}}
<table class="gt">
<thead><tr><th style="width:60px;">Slot</th><th style="width:200px;">Trust</th><th>Why</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td class="lv">1</td><td>🛡️ <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/August">August</a></strong></td><td>Tank — DNC has no Provoke/Flash equivalent</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">2</td><td>✨ <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Apururu_(UC)">Apururu UC</a></strong></td><td>Healer — every Waltz you skip is TP going to a WS instead</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">3</td><td>🎵 <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Joachim">Joachim</a></strong></td><td>March speeds TP gain (more WSes), Madrigal for accuracy</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">4</td><td>✨ <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Koru-Moru">Koru-Moru</a></strong></td><td>Haste on melee (you!), Slow/Distract/Dispel reduce incoming damage</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">5</td><td>⚔️ <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Zeid_II">Zeid II</a></strong></td><td>DPS + 4 stun interrupts protect your melee windows</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
{{/html}}

